<title>UK: Fiat unit sets 300 bln lire five-year bond.</title>
<headline>Fiat unit sets 300 bln lire five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Credito Italiano and Citibank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FIAT FINANCE AND TRADE LTD</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  IHF INTERNATIONALE HOLDINGS FIAT SA</p>
<p> AMT    300 BLN ITL   COUPON     6.2	 MATURITY    27.AUG.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.625   PAY DATE    27.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.90     SPREAD	+15 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (M) 5-50	SALE LIMITS US/UK/IT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  ITALY     TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND FIVE-YEAR BTP</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
